        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Cloud services can scale resources up or down automatically, for example adding servers at peak times and removing them later. Effective resource management, monitoring usage and optimizing performance, is needed to avoid unnecessary costs and keep performance high."
          }
        ]
